# Media — user media never belongs in the repository.
#
# These are ANCHORED on purpose. An unanchored `media/` also matched
# `backend/src/modules/media/`, so six source files were silently kept out of
# the repository and a clean clone failed to build with "Cannot find module
# './modules/media/media.routes.ts'". A pattern meant for uploaded files must
# name where uploads actually live, not any folder that shares the word.
/uploads/
/tmp/
backend/storage/
mobile/uploads/
